  "news": {
   "briefing": [
    {
     "text": "Trump and Putin’s announced ceasefire covering energy infrastructure has left Ukraine and European governments seeking to keep pressure on Moscow; Kyiv was not involved in the announcement, according to Le Monde.",
     "sources": [
      {
       "key": "2034ba7378e664b7",
       "title": "Après l’accord entre Donald Trump et Vladimir Poutine sur le diesel russe, l’Ukraine et l’Europe s’efforcent de maintenir la pression sur le Kremlin",
       "url": "https://www.lemonde.fr/international/article/2026/10/12/apres-l-accord-entre-donald-trump-et-vladimir-poutine-sur-le-diesel-russe-l-ukraine-et-l-europe-s-efforcent-de-maintenir-la-pression-sur-le-kremlin_6792418_3210.html",
       "source": "Le Monde",
       "via": null
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Markets are watching US inflation data, with gold rising as oil and the dollar weakened.",
